    "sections": {
        "description": "Classic Cosmetics is a versatile theme designed for professionals and businesses in the beauty industry, including makeup artists, cosmetic brands, beauty bloggers, beauty salons, skincare centers, makeup studios, spas, cosmetic stores, wellness centers, estheticians, nail salons, hair studios, bridal makeup artists, facial clinics, organic cosmetics brands, beauty boutiques, and glamour studios. Ideal for beauty salon templates, skincare website designs, makeup studio layouts, spa and wellness portals, and cosmetic product showcases, this theme features a clean, elegant design with stylish typography, customizable color options, and a responsive layout that looks flawless on desktops, tablets, and smartphones. It allows you to showcase products, makeup collections, skincare lines, and beauty services with high-quality images and detailed descriptions, while integrated blog sections enable sharing tutorials, product reviews, and industry insights to engage your audience and establish expertise. Built with optimized code, SEO-friendly structure, and user-friendly customization tools, Classic Cosmetics ensures fast loading, professional presentation, and easy management. Compatible with essential plugins for contact forms, e-commerce, and email marketing, this theme provides a polished, high-performing platform to promote beauty products, services, and wellness offerings effectively."
    },
